[2025-07-23 15:14:27 INF] JobId=0d81c0cc-b785-441f-8845-37b4ba49cced QnetTransform.LLMUtils.Interfaces.ILLMInvoker: Response JSON returned from API: {"response":"# Entity Framework Core Project Modernization Summary\n\nThis update modernizes an Entity Framework Core project from .NET 6 to .NET 8 with improvements to database context architecture and naming conventions.\n\n## Key Changes:\n\n* **Framework Upgrade:**\n  * Migrated from .NET 6.0 to .NET 8.0\n  * Updated EF Core packages from 6.0.0 to 8.0.8\n  * Added EntityFramework 6.5.1 package\n\n* **Database Context Improvements:**\n  * Renamed `ApplicationDbContext` to `ProductDbContext`\n  * Updated namespace from `EFCore.DataAccess` to `EFCore.DataAccess.Context`\n  * Renamed `ApplicationDbContextFactory` to `ApplicationDbContextDesignTimeFactory`\n  * Renamed static `Queries` class to `ProductQueries`\n\n* **Project Structure:**\n  * Replaced legacy `packages.config` with PackageReference format\n  * Reorganized csproj file with consistent property ordering\n  * Added porting result JSON for migration tracking\n\n* **Dependencies:**\n  * Updated Microsoft.Extensions packages to 9.0.2\n  * Standardized package references\n\nThe update preserves existing entity relationships and database schema while implementing modern project structure and naming conventions."}.
